    "id": "dnd-weapons-armor-reference",
    "name": "D&D Weapons, Armor, and Ammunition Quick Reference",
    "rulesEdition": "D&D 5e (2014 rules)"
  },
  "normalizationNotes": [
    "Supplied weapon entries were normalized and completed with standard range, ammunition, property, and weight fields where applicable.",
    "Missing standard 2014 weapons and the full standard armor table were added for campaign use.",
    "Specialty arrows are retained but marked as homebrew or optional variants when they are not standard equipment rules.",
    "Costs and weights include display strings for UI rendering and numeric values where a fixed amount is available.",
    "No 2024 weapon mastery properties are included because this collection follows the 2014 rules used by the campaign reference."
  ],
